@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
title Figure 3.16 — Nora MedLink State Transition Diagram: Payment

[*] --> Initiated
Initiated --> PENDING : Card or Raast method selected
Initiated --> SUCCESS : Wallet payment accepted
Initiated --> PAY_ON_VISIT : Cash method selected
PENDING --> SUCCESS : Transaction confirmed
PENDING --> FAILED : Transaction declined or timed out
FAILED --> PENDING : Patient retries payment
SUCCESS --> REFUNDED : Refund issued
PAY_ON_VISIT --> SUCCESS : Cash received at visit
PAY_ON_VISIT --> CANCELLED : Appointment cancelled
SUCCESS --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
